---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import emerge from '../assets/work/emerge.jpg';
import { links, site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="METER — Shalev Lau"
  description="METER is an assistive navigation company I co-founded: ultra-wideband positioning that tells a blind or low-vision user what is around them, in plain language."
>
  <header class="page-head wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>METER</span>
    </nav>

    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:1.5rem 2rem">
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.6rem,1rem+7vw,5.5rem);line-height:0.9;letter-spacing:-0.05em">METER</h1>
      <p class="article__lede" style="max-width:42ch">
        Ultra-wideband navigation for people who cannot see the room they are walking into.
      </p>
    </div>

    <dl class="fact-row">
      <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Co-founder &amp; CFO</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Since</dt><dd>2024</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Based</dt><dd>Hong Kong · Bristol</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Stage</dt><dd>Grant-funded, piloting</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </header>

  <section class="wrap">
    <figure>
      <div class="article__hero">
        <Image src={emerge} alt="Shalev at the Emerge start-up showcase in Sheffield, sitting behind a table with project worksheets." widths={[600, 1000, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 1120px) 92vw, 1120px" format="webp" quality={78} />
      </div>
      <figcaption class="figure-cap">Emerge start-up showcase, Sheffield.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="article-grid">
      <h2>What it is</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          A cane tells you what you have already touched. A guide dog tells you what is straight ahead.
          Neither tells you the door is two metres to your left. METER answers the question people
          actually ask indoors — <em>what is around me, and which way is clear?</em> — with a short spoken
          cue rather than a map.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <div>
        <ul>
          <li>Fixed UWB anchors measure distance by time-of-flight: centimetres, no camera, no light needed.</li>
          <li>A wearable tag fuses ranges, heading and motion on-device, so nothing depends on a network.</li>
          <li>Guidance comes out as one prioritised sentence, fast enough to act on while walking.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2>Where it is</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          We secured an innovation grant to build the first units, pitched to more than fifteen
          investors and partners, and kept the bill of materials lean so the product can stay
          affordable. The company is still early — happy to talk through the technical or commercial
          side directly.
        </p>
        <p class="fineprint">
          What I own: company formation and finance, the full-stack platform (Express/Node, Next.js,
          MySQL), hardware–software integration, and the investor narrative.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          <a href={links.email} style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)">{site.email}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
